WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.877
Okay, let's do some tests.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:14.214
Tell me when you see something
that makes sound.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.685
I see a speaker which makes sound.

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.956
What is that part of the speaker called?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.458
That is the tweeter.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.461
It produces high-frequency sounds.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:34.701
Give me a creative alliteration
about these.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.872
Creative crayons color cheerfully.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.875
They certainly craft colorful creations.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.215
What does that part of the code do?

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:51.484
This code

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.487
defines encryption
and decryption functions.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.691
It seems to use AES-CBC encryption to encode

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:02.462
and decode data based on a key
and an initialization vector

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.565
(IV).

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:08.468
That's right.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:11.471
What neighborhood do you think I'm in?

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:13.640
This appears to be

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.077
The King's Cross
area of London. It is known for its railway

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:20.080
station and transportation connections.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:24.350
Do you remember where you saw my glasses?

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:26.986
Yes I do.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.189
Your glasses were
on the desk near a red apple.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.836
What can I add here

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:45.839
to make this system faster?

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:48.475
Adding a cache between

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:51.478
the server and database
could improve speed.

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:56.049
What does this remind you of?

00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:00.820
Schrödinger's cat.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.457
All right, give me a band name

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.893
for this duo.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.130
Golden stripes.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.498
Nice. Thanks, Gemini.

